  unitName: Rameldria
  unitId: 50104
  unitNumber: 149
  description: The strongest and highest ranked in the history of all dragons, Rameldria
    engaged in many battles with many beings, even gods. This can be traced back
    to myths from long ago. None who lost to Rameldria were recorded as having survived,
    and it's believed that when the world is on the verge of abyssal despair, its
    tremendous power will return once again.
  summonDesc: I can feel your intention.<br>If you're really planning on <br>exceed
    the heavens, I'll help.
  fusionDesc: Can you hear the angry<br>voice of the planet?
  evoDesc: So you've come to fight.<br>Let my strength be your<br>weapon.
